, Taira still overthinks everything around him, especially after his classmate Shino Azuma began giving him more attention. Simultaneously, the usually energetic and outspoken Yamada finds it difficult to find the perfect time to confess his feelings to his shy schoolmate Natsumi Nishi. Despite everyone's differences, they continue enjoying their adolescence together and find their own ways to turn the winter break into a cherished memory.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Iyashikei","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gyaru","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Trains","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"You and I Are Polar Opposites Season 2","english":"You and I Are Polar Opposites Season 2","native":"正反対な君と僕 第2期","romaji":"Seihantai na Kimi to Boku 2nd Season","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"相反的你和我 第二季"}]},"trailer":{"id":"HW7enBbU_hk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HW7enBbU_hk/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}